<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>FREE-ADVICE Request Rejected</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #dc3545; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; }
        .details { background-color: white; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
        .status { padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold; }
        .status.rejected { background-color: #dc3545; color: white; }
        .rejection-reason { background-color: #f8d7da; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #dc3545; border-radius: 5px; }
        .next-steps { background-color: #d1ecf1; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8; border-radius: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>❌ FREE-ADVICE Request Rejected</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{ trucker.fullName }},</p>
            
            <p>We regret to inform you that your FREE-ADVICE request has been rejected by our Terminal Team.</p>
            
            <div class="details">
                <h3>Request Details:</h3>
                <p><strong>Reference Number:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.id }}</p>
                <p><strong>Container Number:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.container.containerNumber }}</p>
                <p><strong>Terminal:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.selectedTerminal.name }} ({{ preAdviceRequest.selectedTerminal.type.value }})</p>
                <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="status rejected">{{ preAdviceRequest.status.value|title }}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Reviewed by:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.verifiedBy.fullName }}</p>
                <p><strong>Reviewed on:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.verifiedAt|date('Y-m-d H:i:s') }}</p>
            </div>
            
            {% if preAdviceRequest.rejectionReason %}
            <div class="rejection-reason">
                <h3>🔍 Rejection Reason:</h3>
                <p>{{ preAdviceRequest.rejectionReason }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            <div class="next-steps">
                <h3>📋 What You Can Do Next:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Review the rejection reason carefully</li>
                    <li>Address the issues mentioned in the rejection reason</li>
                    <li>Take new photos if photo quality was the issue</li>
                    <li>Ensure container condition meets terminal requirements</li>
                    <li>Submit a new FREE-ADVICE request with corrected information</li>
                    <li>Contact our support team if you need clarification</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="details">
                <h3>Common Rejection Reasons:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Photo Quality:</strong> Photos are blurry, dark, or don't show container clearly</li>
                    <li><strong>GPS Coordinates:</strong> Photos missing location data or taken at wrong location</li>
                    <li><strong>Container Condition:</strong> Visible damage or condition issues</li>
                    <li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Missing or incorrect container information</li>
                    <li><strong>Terminal Capacity:</strong> Selected terminal cannot accommodate the container</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p>We encourage you to address the issues and submit a new request. Our team is here to help ensure your container return process goes smoothly.</p>
            
            <p>If you have any questions about this rejection, please contact our Terminal Team support.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from OPTIMUS Shipping Portal.<br>
            Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>